//│ flow-analysis > function leaf_pure#0 @ <root> -> Pure
//│ flow-analysis > function node_direct_effectful#0 @ <root> -> UnsafeEta
//│ flow-analysis > function node_direct_pure#0 @ <root> -> Pure
//│ flow-analysis > function node_effectful#0 @ <root> -> UnsafeEta
//│ flow-analysis > function node_pure#0 @ <root> -> Pure
//│ flow-analysis > call ,@result @ <root> -> Pure
//│ flow-analysis > call caller_effectful@result @ <root> -> UnsafeEta
//│ flow-analysis > call caller_pure@result @ <root> -> Pure
//│ flow-analysis > call effect@result @ <root> -> UnsafeEta
//│ flow-analysis > call effect@result @ <root> -> UnsafeEta
//│ flow-analysis > call f@result @ <root> -> Pure
//│ flow-analysis > call f@result @ <root> -> UnsafeEta
//│ flow-analysis > call leaf_effectful@result @ <root> -> UnsafeEta
//│ flow-analysis > call leaf_pure@result @ <root> -> Pure
//│ flow-analysis > call node_direct_effectful@result @ <root> -> UnsafeEta
//│ flow-analysis > call node_direct_pure@result @ <root> -> Pure
//│ flow-analysis > call node_effectful@result @ <root> -> UnsafeEta
//│ flow-analysis > call node_pure@result @ <root> -> Pure
